      "id": "g_pronoun_drop",
      "grammar": true,
      "english": "I'm a student. (pronoun optional)",
      "word": "(Yo) soy estudiante.",
      "grammarNote": "Spanish usually **drops the subject pronoun** — the verb ending already shows who the subject is.\n**Soy estudiante** = **Yo soy estudiante**. Add **yo/tú/él** only for emphasis or contrast.",
      "englishPhrase": "I'm a student, and you?",
      "phrase": "Soy estudiante, ¿y tú?",
